WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:03.980
This story is a work of fiction. The names of all of the characters, organizations, and so on
 are imaginary. It also bears no connection to any specific real-life events.

00:47.460 --> 00:52.530
<b>This is medicine that can heal your 
heart and erase all worldly pains.</b>

01:09.380 --> 01:16.510
<b>The Apothecary Diaries</b>

02:33.870 --> 02:37.890
Episode 49: Locusts

02:38.750 --> 02:40.680
<b>A locust plague?</b>

02:40.950 --> 02:45.160
<b>Yes. That was written on 
the note Loulan handed to me.</b>

02:45.660 --> 02:47.730
<b>If a locust plague breaks out now...</b>

02:47.810 --> 02:49.560
<b>The citizenry will surely point their ire</b>

02:49.640 --> 02:53.990
<b>toward the ruler of 
the nation of Li... our emperor.</b>

02:56.740 --> 02:58.910
<b><i>The Shi clan was destroyed.</i></b>

02:59.660 --> 03:00.530
<b><i>As a result,</i></b>

03:00.910 --> 03:05.460
<b><i>there's a high chance that more political 
conflict will occur within the palace.</i></b>

03:06.540 --> 03:08.130
<b><i>The named clans.</i></b>

03:08.670 --> 03:13.760
<b><i>Those that were given a character only 
they could use in their names...</i></b>

03:16.090 --> 03:18.930
<b><i>The three vassals who 
helped establish the nation</i></b>

03:19.010 --> 03:19.430
<b><i>happened to have the characters 
representing a zodiac in their names.</i></b>

03:19.510 --> 03:20.390
<b>Shi</b>

03:21.390 --> 03:21.600
<b>Yi</b>

03:21.680 --> 03:23.190
<b><i>From there, it became 
customary for the emperor</i></b>

03:23.270 --> 03:24.020
<b>Mi</b>

03:24.100 --> 03:26.980
<b><i>to grant a zodiac-based name
to clans that served the emperor well.</i></b>

03:27.060 --> 03:30.440
<b><i>Later, this practice expanded to include 
characters unrelated to the zodiac.</i></b>

03:30.520 --> 03:31.940
<b><i>This led to the oldest twelve clans 
being treated separately</i></b>

03:32.020 --> 03:32.700
<b>La</b>

03:32.780 --> 03:34.610
<b><i>from the newer clans 
that joined afterwards.</i></b>

03:34.690 --> 03:39.030
<b><i>One such newly joined clan 
is the "La" clan.</i></b>

03:39.490 --> 03:43.540
<b><i>Concubine Gyokuyou will soon rise to 
empress consort from high-rank concubine.</i></b>

03:44.120 --> 03:46.920
<b><i>Her family will most likely be raised to 
the status of named clan, like the La.</i></b>

03:47.000 --> 03:51.000
<b>Gyoku       Yi</b>

03:51.340 --> 03:54.880
<b>If war were to break out, 
the west would become indispensable.</b>

03:55.840 --> 04:00.090
<b>Is that why you're raising Gyokuen's 
daughter, Concubine Gyokuyou, to empress?</b>

04:00.390 --> 04:03.100
<b>Marriage is another tool in politics.</b>

04:03.810 --> 04:08.560
<b><i>After the Yi clan, the western rulers, 
ceased to exist around a decade ago,</i></b>

04:08.640 --> 04:10.230
<b><i>the one who took charge in their wake was
 You Gyokuen, Concubine Gyokuyou's father.</i></b>

04:10.310 --> 04:13.570
<b>Gyokuen</b>

04:13.940 --> 04:17.030
<b><i>Meanwhile, Empress Dowager 
Anshi's family was not given a name.</i></b>

04:17.110 --> 04:19.950
<b><i>The Empress made sure they didn't.</i></b>

04:23.830 --> 04:28.210
<b>I just have to hope this doesn't 
cause more conflict in the future.</b>

04:48.350 --> 04:50.440
<b>Who would've thought Master Jinshi was...</b>

04:50.770 --> 04:52.360
<b>The Imperial Younger Brother...</b>

04:52.440 --> 04:55.740
<b>Master Gyokuen! 
Congratulations on the great news!</b>

04:55.820 --> 04:57.700
<b>Oh, thank you.</b>

04:57.780 --> 04:59.570
<b>Please, enjoy this drink.</b>

04:59.650 --> 05:00.870
<b>I am grateful.</b>

05:00.950 --> 05:02.490
<b>Yes, great news indeed.</b>

05:02.870 --> 05:05.200
<b>What a splendid announcement!</b>

05:11.120 --> 05:13.210
<b>Where is my father?!</b>

05:13.540 --> 05:15.800
<b>Yes, this is worrying.</b>

05:15.880 --> 05:18.340
<b>Master Onsou went to get him, but...</b>

05:18.420 --> 05:20.180
<b>It's going to start!</b>

05:20.260 --> 05:21.600
<b>Let's give up!</b>

05:21.680 --> 05:24.970
<b>Master Rikuson, perhaps you could 
sit in my father's seat in his stead—</b>

05:25.050 --> 05:26.760
<b>I <i>obviously</i> decline.</b>

05:28.640 --> 05:30.560
<b>Let's count on Master Onsou.</b>

05:30.640 --> 05:32.270
<b>Let's do that.</b>

05:32.600 --> 05:34.190
<b>Master Lakan!</b>

05:37.650 --> 05:39.660
<b>Quiet please, Master Onsou.</b>

05:39.740 --> 05:44.530
<b>Quiet? Today is the garden party 
announcing the new empress dowager—</b>

05:51.750 --> 05:55.500
<b>Oh, nice move! Let's see...</b>

05:55.580 --> 05:59.760
<b>Lady Fengxian is in good health 
today for the first time in weeks.</b>

05:59.840 --> 06:02.550
<b>Well, how would you respond to this?</b>

06:10.850 --> 06:14.730
<b>I'm in so much trouble...</b>

06:26.620 --> 06:28.280
<b>Oh, Father!</b>

06:28.950 --> 06:29.790
<b>Hmph.</b>

06:29.870 --> 06:31.420
<b>Here, Master Uryuu.</b>

06:31.500 --> 06:32.410
<b>Yes.</b>

06:36.330 --> 06:37.580
<b><i>Lady Lishu...</i></b>

06:38.460 --> 06:43.010
<b>Oh, if only Lady Lihua's son 
was born just a little sooner...</b>

06:43.090 --> 06:45.840
<b>If only the first prince survived...</b>

06:46.140 --> 06:48.970
<b>Look at Gyokuen, beaming with pride.</b>

06:49.220 --> 06:52.560
<b>An empress with foreign blood? 
How could he...</b>

07:15.660 --> 07:16.750
<b>It's cold...</b>

07:16.830 --> 07:19.130
<b><i>Oh yeah, Grams wanted to see me.</i></b>

07:21.800 --> 07:24.510
<b><i>I guess I'll let Chou-u sleep in.</i></b>

07:24.590 --> 07:28.010
<b><i>I'll score myself a bath 
at the Verdigris House, too.</i></b>

07:32.760 --> 07:34.690
<b><i>It's been a month 
since I left the rear palace.</i></b>

07:34.770 --> 07:35.600
<b><i>The new year's festive air 
has settled down now.</i></b>

07:35.680 --> 07:37.230
<b>Good morning.</b>

07:37.310 --> 07:38.350
<b>Morning.</b>

07:41.060 --> 07:43.030
<b>Morning, Meimei.</b>

07:43.110 --> 07:44.700
<b>You're early today.</b>

07:44.780 --> 07:45.910
<b>Have you seen Grams?</b>

07:45.990 --> 07:47.950
<b>She's talking to the owner over there.</b>

07:48.030 --> 07:51.240
<b>You fool! What were you thinking?!</b>

07:53.490 --> 07:56.210
<b><i>Grams runs the Verdigris House,</i></b>

07:56.290 --> 07:59.630
<b><i>but the actual business owner is 
a different man we call Mr. Owner.</i></b>

07:59.710 --> 08:02.050
<b><i>He owns other businesses as well.</i></b>

08:02.130 --> 08:04.050
<b><i>He's soft-hearted to a fault,</i></b>

08:04.130 --> 08:07.880
<b><i>and probably couldn't run 
the Verdigris House without Grams.</i></b>

08:08.510 --> 08:10.890
<b><i>Looks like he got a solid whack 
from the old lady.</i></b>

08:10.970 --> 08:13.680
<b>Hey, Maomao. You're here?</b>

08:13.760 --> 08:15.520
<b>You told me to come.</b>

08:15.600 --> 08:16.850
<b>Did I now?</b>

08:16.930 --> 08:17.980
<b>Finally going senile—</b>

08:18.060 --> 08:18.520
<b>Ow!</b>

08:18.600 --> 08:19.390
<b>I heard that!</b>

08:21.480 --> 08:23.110
<b><i>Reminds me of a certain quack doctor...</i></b>

08:23.190 --> 08:26.110
<b>From the looks of it, 
you want a bath, don't you?</b>

08:26.190 --> 08:30.620
<b>You want breakfast, too? 
Bring that kid along.</b>

08:30.700 --> 08:31.450
<b>Are you sure?</b>

08:31.530 --> 08:33.870
<b>I can be generous on occasion.</b>

08:33.950 --> 08:35.950
<b>I'll be off, then.</b>

08:37.580 --> 08:41.120
<b><i>Hmm? He usually stays for breakfast.</i></b>

08:41.880 --> 08:44.460
<b>There! It's all you can eat!</b>

08:46.590 --> 08:49.640
<b>Yuck... These are locusts, right?</b>

08:49.720 --> 08:52.180
<b>These were a gift from Mr. Owner.</b>

08:52.260 --> 08:55.100
<b>Someone begged him to take them, 
due to a bad harvest.</b>

08:55.640 --> 08:59.140
<b><i>Mr. Owner deals with grains.</i></b>

08:59.560 --> 09:04.490
<b><i>In this nation, the government takes 
a portion of a farmer's yield as tax,</i></b>

09:04.570 --> 09:07.480
<b><i>and buys up another certain portion.</i></b>

09:07.900 --> 09:11.780
<b><i>Mr. Owner makes money 
by trading the remainder.</i></b>

09:11.860 --> 09:13.990
<b>He paid their asking price,</b>

09:14.070 --> 09:17.620
<b>and used expensive sugar 
to preserve them via broiling.</b>

09:17.700 --> 09:20.410
<b>Should just toss 'em rather 
than go through all the trouble!</b>

09:21.580 --> 09:23.250
<b>Chou-u, you're fine with these?</b>

09:23.330 --> 09:25.260
<b>This isn't very good.</b>

09:25.340 --> 09:27.300
<b>How can you eat that?</b>

09:27.380 --> 09:30.260
<b>It tastes pretty empty, 
but it's still edible.</b>

09:30.340 --> 09:31.510
<b>"Empty?"</b>

09:31.590 --> 09:33.010
<b>Shut up and eat!</b>

09:33.300 --> 09:35.930
<b>Hey, should I eat this for you?</b>

09:36.010 --> 09:37.890
<b>I'll only charge one 
mooncake in exchange.</b>

09:38.430 --> 09:40.270
<b>Ow! That hurts, Freckles!</b>

09:40.350 --> 09:41.520
<b>Oh dear.</b>

09:44.020 --> 09:46.860
<b><i>Locusts are gutted before cooking.</i></b>

09:46.940 --> 09:49.820
<b><i>It's only natural that they're 
hollow inside, but...</i></b>

09:49.900 --> 09:51.240
<b>Oh, Maomao.</b>

09:51.320 --> 09:52.320
<b>What is it?</b>

09:52.400 --> 09:55.790
<b>I just remembered. Go to the market 
and buy some incense for me.</b>

09:55.870 --> 09:57.410
<b>Sure. Do I get a tip?</b>

09:57.490 --> 10:01.210
<b>Hmph! You got a morning bath 
and two free breakfasts.</b>

10:01.290 --> 10:02.420
<b>That's more than enough, no?</b>

10:02.500 --> 10:03.040
<b>Cheap.</b>

10:03.120 --> 10:05.380
<b>Huh? Did you say something?</b>

10:05.880 --> 10:09.050
<b>Hey Freckles! Buy me that!</b>

10:09.130 --> 10:10.170
<b>Declined!</b>

10:12.420 --> 10:13.850
<b><i>Being here now,</i></b>

10:13.930 --> 10:17.470
<b><i>it feels like the time I spent working in 
that place was a dream or something.</i></b>

10:19.010 --> 10:20.730
<b>Gross!</b>

10:20.810 --> 10:21.900
<b>That idiot...!</b>

10:21.980 --> 10:23.520
<b>What did you say, you brat?!</b>

10:23.600 --> 10:25.320
<b>These are empty and gross.</b>

10:25.400 --> 10:26.360
<b>You little...!</b>

10:26.440 --> 10:29.240
<b>Chou-u! What are you doing?!</b>

10:29.320 --> 10:30.240
<b>Sorry about that!</b>

10:30.320 --> 10:32.450
<b>What was that for?! It's the truth!</b>

10:32.530 --> 10:34.450
<b>Just shut up!</b>

10:35.910 --> 10:37.700
<b>It really was gross.</b>

10:38.200 --> 10:41.910
<b>Darn. The crops are gonna be 
really bad this year.</b>

10:42.580 --> 10:43.710
<b>What did you just say?</b>

10:43.790 --> 10:45.460
<b>Huh? It was gross.</b>

10:45.540 --> 10:46.830
<b>No, after that.</b>

10:47.080 --> 10:50.550
<b>Uh, the harvest is gonna be bad?</b>

10:50.630 --> 10:52.340
<b>That. How do you know?</b>

10:52.420 --> 10:54.220
<b>I don't remember.</b>

10:54.300 --> 10:57.430
<b>Something to do with skinny bugs 
followed by bad harvests.</b>

10:58.430 --> 11:01.690
<b><i>Chou-u died once and came back to life.</i></b>

11:01.770 --> 11:06.440
<b><i>Because of that, he has some paralysis 
and lost a large part of his memory.</i></b>

11:08.230 --> 11:11.570
<b>Ow! Ow! Stop it!</b>

11:11.650 --> 11:12.360
<b>Oh?</b>

11:13.110 --> 11:15.120
<b>I might be able to remember!</b>

11:15.200 --> 11:15.950
<b>Really?!</b>

11:16.030 --> 11:17.780
<b>If you buy me something!</b>

11:18.820 --> 11:20.950
<b>Ow! Ow!</b>

11:21.740 --> 11:24.450
<b>What a way to jog a memory.</b>

11:27.790 --> 11:31.470
<b><i>But I didn't expect him 
to ask for pen and paper.</i></b>

11:31.550 --> 11:34.680
<b>Chou-u, I'm going to deliver 
the incense to the old lady.</b>

11:34.760 --> 11:36.220
<b>Don't do anything stupid.</b>

11:36.300 --> 11:37.510
<b>Got it!</b>

11:42.600 --> 11:44.690
<b>Wow, that's great!</b>

11:44.770 --> 11:44.940
<b>Draw me next!</b>

11:45.020 --> 11:47.310
<b>Huh? What's that?</b>

11:48.400 --> 11:50.900
<b>Wait, wait! In order please!</b>

11:51.190 --> 11:53.020
<b>There, finished!</b>

11:54.230 --> 11:54.950
<b>Here.</b>

11:55.030 --> 11:59.490
<b>Wow, you really are good, kiddo! Here's a tip.</b>

11:59.570 --> 12:01.040
<b>Thanks for the business!</b>

12:01.120 --> 12:01.580
<b>Hey!</b>

12:01.660 --> 12:03.870
<b>Ow! What's that for, Freckles?!</b>

12:03.950 --> 12:05.120
<b>What are you doing?</b>

12:05.200 --> 12:07.380
<b>Well, drawing, obviously.</b>

12:07.460 --> 12:09.290
<b>And charging money...</b>

12:09.370 --> 12:13.420
<b>Hey! What are you doing 
blocking traffic?! Out of the way!</b>

12:16.340 --> 12:17.840
<b>Sneak, sneak, sneak...</b>

12:17.920 --> 12:19.140
<b>Stop!</b>

12:19.220 --> 12:23.980
<b>Let the kid know I'll only 
charge 10% for the location.</b>

12:24.060 --> 12:25.850
<b>Greedy old hag...</b>

12:33.310 --> 12:36.900
<b>If you're going to keep doing that there, 
make sure you pay the old lady.</b>

12:37.190 --> 12:41.870
<b>What? No way, I'll just go somewhere else.</b>

12:45.080 --> 12:48.540
<b>Even if you have to pay, 
stay near the Verdigris House.</b>

12:48.620 --> 12:51.340
<b>Don't go anywhere the menservants
 can't keep an eye on you.</b>

12:51.420 --> 12:53.670
<b>Don't go buying paper by yourself, either.</b>

12:53.750 --> 12:55.630
<b>That's none of your business!</b>

12:58.880 --> 13:00.470
<b>W-What?</b>

13:00.550 --> 13:02.890
<b>If you want to become 
a flesh chunk, go ahead.</b>

13:02.970 --> 13:04.350
<b>Flesh chunk?</b>

13:05.470 --> 13:07.350
<b>Those types of people would come get you.</b>

13:14.770 --> 13:17.110
<b>That's a courtesan that caught a disease.</b>

13:17.190 --> 13:21.280
<b>She won't live for much longer, 
but she still needs a client to survive.</b>

13:21.820 --> 13:23.990
<b>The pleasure district 
isn't all glitz and glamour.</b>

13:24.530 --> 13:27.160
<b>The darkness runs deep as well.</b>

13:28.440 --> 13:30.790
<b>You don't see it when you're 
in the Verdigris House,</b>

13:30.870 --> 13:35.760
<b>but there are loads of guys who would 
gladly kill a kid to take his money.</b>

13:35.840 --> 13:37.710
<b>I-I get it.</b>

13:45.300 --> 13:49.020
<b><i>I didn't expect him to have 
this talent, though.</i></b>

13:49.100 --> 13:50.310
<b><i>It's almost like...</i></b>

13:53.060 --> 13:54.230
<b>Oh yeah, look.</b>

13:54.940 --> 13:56.530
<b>I remembered this.</b>

13:56.610 --> 13:58.780
<b>Is this... a locust?</b>

13:58.860 --> 14:01.620
<b>The top one is a normal locust,</b>

14:01.700 --> 14:05.370
<b>and the other's a locust 
during a bad harvest... I think.</b>

14:06.320 --> 14:07.580
<b>A locust plague.</b>

14:09.040 --> 14:12.330
<b><i>It's a calamity that can 
destroy a whole nation.</i></b>

14:19.420 --> 14:23.260
<b><i>A plague of locusts 
can eat through anything.</i></b>

14:23.340 --> 14:27.180
<b><i>Not just crops, but straw rope 
and sandals as well.</i></b>

14:27.760 --> 14:32.680
<b><i>Fortunately, during this emperor's 
reign, we've yet to see a locust plague.</i></b>

14:33.100 --> 14:36.980
<b><i>But many were executed after 
the Shi clan's rebellion.</i></b>

14:40.780 --> 14:42.490
<b><i>If a locust plague broke out now,</i></b>

14:42.570 --> 14:46.580
<b><i>some will certainly claim it's divine 
retribution for destroying the Shi clan.</i></b>

14:46.660 --> 14:50.950
<b><i>If that happened, people would 
point the blame at the emperor...</i></b>

14:53.120 --> 14:55.920
<b><i>No. It's none of my business.</i></b>

14:56.880 --> 14:58.710
<b><i>It's none of my business, but...</i></b>

15:01.460 --> 15:03.590
<b><i>Seeing Chou-u's drawing reminded me...</i></b>

15:04.840 --> 15:07.510
<b><i>I saw pictures like that before.</i></b>

15:08.090 --> 15:10.640
<b><i>There's no way it'd be here...</i></b>

15:15.100 --> 15:16.230
<b>Sir!</b>

15:18.100 --> 15:19.650
<b>Where did you get this book?</b>

15:19.730 --> 15:23.240
<b>Oh, a guy came in and 
sold it to me a while ago.</b>

15:23.320 --> 15:25.280
<b>Did he come to sell anything else?</b>

15:25.700 --> 15:29.660
<b>Just that one. He did say 
he'll come again, though.</b>

15:32.990 --> 15:35.960
<b><i>This was one of the diagrams 
in the references I got</i></b>

15:36.040 --> 15:36.460
<b><i>when I was told to make 
the immortality potion.</i></b>

15:36.540 --> 15:38.210
<b>Plants: Vol. Two</b>

15:38.290 --> 15:40.540
<b>Birds: Vol. One</b>

15:43.550 --> 15:46.550
<b><i>This book is definitely the one.</i></b>

15:46.840 --> 15:47.930
<b>Thank you!</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:49.930
<b><i>Why is it here...?</i></b>

15:51.970 --> 15:55.020
<b><i>The stronghold was locked 
down by the royal guard.</i></b>

15:55.100 --> 15:58.730
<b><i>How is a book from that stronghold 
circulating in the market?</i></b>

15:59.480 --> 16:02.520
<b><i>Is someone secretly 
selling off confiscated goods?</i></b>

16:03.150 --> 16:04.320
<b><i>If so...</i></b>

16:04.730 --> 16:06.070
<b>The royal guard...</b>

16:06.860 --> 16:09.320
<b>Maybe I'll try asking <i>him</i>.</b>

16:09.990 --> 16:11.490
<b>Verdigris House</b>

16:11.490 --> 16:13.250
<b>Fish: Vol. One</b>

16:15.290 --> 16:17.380
<b>Hunting petty thieves is, you know...</b>

16:17.460 --> 16:19.960
<b>Thank you, Master Lihaku.</b>

16:20.040 --> 16:23.970
<b>I kept watch starting in the morning 
and caught the guy trying to sell this.</b>

16:24.050 --> 16:25.220
<b>You owe me one.</b>

16:25.300 --> 16:27.590
<b>You didn't get one of 
your subordinates to do it?</b>

16:27.670 --> 16:30.220
<b>Well, it's a request from you, after all.</b>

16:31.890 --> 16:34.020
<b>So, if you could just let Pairin know...</b>

16:34.100 --> 16:36.140
<b>Ah. Yeah, sure.</b>

16:36.220 --> 16:38.020
<b>Where's the culprit, anyway?</b>

16:38.100 --> 16:40.940
<b>The Verdigris House menservants 
are holding him outside.</b>

16:41.020 --> 16:42.270
<b>I see.</b>

16:47.240 --> 16:48.030
<b>Little lady!</b>

16:49.780 --> 16:52.740
<b>Careful, don't get too close.</b>

16:55.200 --> 16:57.410
<b>Hey! The snake girl!</b>

16:59.210 --> 17:02.000
<b><i>Ah, it's the guard from back then.</i></b>

17:02.080 --> 17:03.380
<b>What's wrong, little lady?</b>

17:03.460 --> 17:05.750
<b>I'm sorry, Master Lihaku.</b>

17:06.460 --> 17:08.800
<b>I know this guy.</b>

17:09.130 --> 17:11.130
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

17:11.510 --> 17:15.640
<b>Oh, I just remembered, Pairin is 
just about to get some free time...</b>

17:15.720 --> 17:18.730
<b>Right! I think I'll leave you 
to it, then! Later!</b>

17:19.480 --> 17:22.070
<b>Ukyou, you don't have to 
hang around, either.</b>

17:22.150 --> 17:23.980
<b>I can't leave you here.</b>

17:24.060 --> 17:25.900
<b>If something happened to you,</b>

17:25.980 --> 17:28.820
<b>a certain fox-like man and a certain
 masked man would be mad at me.</b>

17:29.150 --> 17:33.700
<b>Don't worry. I'll just be here, 
not speaking and not listening.</b>

17:35.120 --> 17:38.420
<b><i>Ukyou has been here since 
before I was born.</i></b>

17:38.500 --> 17:42.870
<b><i>He can handle pretty much any task, 
and is well-trusted by the old lady.</i></b>

17:43.250 --> 17:45.630
<b><i>He'll probably squeal to
 Grams about this, but...</i></b>

17:46.340 --> 17:48.880
<b><i>I guess that's alright.</i></b>

17:49.710 --> 17:51.800
<b>You've seen this before, right?</b>

17:51.880 --> 17:53.590
<b>What happened to the other books?</b>

17:55.930 --> 17:59.350
<b>The officer from earlier was part of 
the army that took down the stronghold.</b>

17:59.680 --> 18:02.890
<b>Should I tell him you were there?</b>

18:04.270 --> 18:05.900
<b>Fine...</b>

18:05.980 --> 18:07.940
<b>I sold two of the books 
in a different town,</b>

18:08.020 --> 18:09.950
<b>and have three more with me.</b>

18:10.030 --> 18:11.440
<b>The rest I left behind.</b>

18:12.030 --> 18:15.910
<b><i>I might be able to get 
the volumes still at the stronghold.</i></b>

18:15.990 --> 18:18.040
<b><i>The two he sold off are the problem.</i></b>

18:18.120 --> 18:22.040
<b><i>Right now, I have the "Birds" 
and "Fish" books.</i></b>

18:22.630 --> 18:24.540
<b>Did you sell the "Insects" book?</b>

18:24.620 --> 18:26.580
<b>I still have one of them.</b>

18:27.040 --> 18:27.340
<b><i>One of them...</i></b>

18:27.420 --> 18:28.670
<b>Birds: Vol. One</b>

18:28.750 --> 18:31.550
<b><i>This says "Volume One."
So, there must be a "Volume Two."</i></b>

18:31.880 --> 18:34.550
<b>Can you bring it to me right away?</b>

18:34.630 --> 18:37.770
<b>Will you promise not to turn me in?</b>

18:37.850 --> 18:39.970
<b>Depends on your attitude.</b>

18:40.430 --> 18:41.850
<b>Hey, Maomao.</b>

18:41.930 --> 18:44.110
<b>You're just shaking him 
down at this point.</b>

18:44.190 --> 18:46.190
<b>Hey, aren't you hungry?</b>

18:46.600 --> 18:49.690
<b>You seem like you went 
through a lot. Just wait.</b>

18:55.820 --> 18:57.700
<b>C-Can I eat this?!</b>

18:57.780 --> 18:59.830
<b>Sure. It's just leftovers, though.</b>

19:03.500 --> 19:04.830
<b>Oh, so good!</b>

19:05.210 --> 19:09.090
<b>I can see he went through 
a lot before he got here.</b>

19:09.170 --> 19:11.420
<b>He seemed to be treating 
the books well, too.</b>

19:11.500 --> 19:13.970
<b>Seems like he sold them 
out of necessity, no?</b>

19:14.050 --> 19:16.220
<b>He doesn't strike me as a bad person.</b>

19:16.300 --> 19:17.510
<b>Maybe.</b>

19:18.010 --> 19:20.510
<b>Maomao, it's carrot and stick.</b>

19:24.930 --> 19:26.020
<b>What's wrong?</b>

19:26.100 --> 19:27.190
<b>Yuck.</b>

19:27.270 --> 19:28.810
<b>You don't like locusts?</b>

19:29.770 --> 19:32.690
<b>This isn't a locust, it's a grasshopper.</b>

19:36.240 --> 19:39.240
<b>These are locusts, 
and these are grasshoppers.</b>

19:39.320 --> 19:41.290
<b>Farmers separate them.</b>

19:41.370 --> 19:44.790
<b>Locusts are edible, but grasshoppers 
taste empty and bad.</b>

19:45.080 --> 19:48.960
<b>Yuck, that one was a grasshopper!</b>

19:49.040 --> 19:51.340
<b><i>Shisui said the same thing.</i></b>

19:51.420 --> 19:53.630
<b>But, this...</b>

19:54.210 --> 19:55.050
<b>What is it?</b>

19:55.130 --> 19:57.760
<b>We might be facing a famine this year.</b>

19:57.840 --> 19:59.180
<b>I knew it.</b>

19:59.260 --> 20:01.270
<b>I-I don't know for sure!</b>

20:01.350 --> 20:04.940
<b>But often, in a year after one where 
you get more grasshoppers than locusts,</b>

20:05.020 --> 20:07.100
<b>you get a lot of bad insect damage.</b>

20:08.100 --> 20:10.530
<b>Just like Chou-u said.</b>

20:10.610 --> 20:14.700
<b>Hey, you know a lot about 
insects for a guard.</b>

20:14.780 --> 20:16.320
<b>W-Well...</b>

20:16.400 --> 20:19.740
<b>Besides, why did you take 
books from the fortress?</b>

20:19.820 --> 20:22.450
<b>I'm sure there were 
more expensive things there.</b>

20:23.330 --> 20:26.000
<b>I didn't want to sell it.</b>

20:26.080 --> 20:28.500
<b>I was going to buy it all back 
when I got the chance.</b>

20:28.580 --> 20:31.710
<b>Nobody goes out of their way 
to buy illustrated books, right?</b>

20:31.790 --> 20:33.460
<b>Except this one.</b>

20:36.380 --> 20:41.360
<b>I used to bring food to the old man 
who was there before you.</b>

20:42.300 --> 20:44.770
<b>The apothecary who was researching 
the immortality potion?</b>

20:44.850 --> 20:48.020
<b>Yeah. But he did other things, too.</b>

20:48.100 --> 20:50.610
<b>One of them was this research.</b>

20:50.690 --> 20:53.650
<b>How to avoid causing a locust plague...</b>

20:53.730 --> 20:54.860
<b>That's...</b>

20:57.070 --> 20:59.950
<b>Hey Freckles! Can I eat your dumplings?!</b>

21:00.030 --> 21:01.490
<b>Huh? Young sir—</b>

21:03.870 --> 21:06.210
<b><i>I forgot he knows about Chou-u!</i></b>

21:06.290 --> 21:09.040
<b><i>The Shi clan were officially wiped out.</i></b>

21:09.120 --> 21:10.710
<b><i>He can't know about this!</i></b>

21:11.040 --> 21:13.250
<b>Take the dumplings. Just go away.</b>

21:13.330 --> 21:14.170
<b>What's with you?</b>

21:14.250 --> 21:16.880
<b>Chou-u, you can ride on my shoulders.</b>

21:16.960 --> 21:19.090
<b>Really?! Thanks!</b>

21:22.890 --> 21:28.310
<b><i>I don't know for sure, but perhaps 
I should let Master Jinshi know...</i></b>

21:49.500 --> 21:52.420
<b>I think it's time I fulfilled my promise.</b>

21:52.920 --> 21:54.080
<b>Meaning?</b>

21:54.750 --> 21:58.090
<b>I think it's time for Yue 
to choose a flower.</b>

22:03.630 --> 22:05.600
<b>Master Jinshi, it's time.</b>

22:06.510 --> 22:07.560
<b>Yes...</b>

23:45.070 --> 23:53.540
Next Time

23:53.620 --> 23:53.620
Episode 50: The Fire-Rat Cloak

23:53.700 --> 23:57.140
<b><i>Next time: "The Fire-Rat Cloak."</i></b>
